Cyber News Shorts

This product includes software developed by the Cyber News Shorts contributors.

Default branding strings in this repository use "ThreatNoir" as an example brand.
All branding is intended to be env-configurable for downstream users.

This project integrates with (optional) third-party services and APIs, including:
ElevenLabs, HeyGen, Pexels, Storyblocks, OpenRouter, Runware, and Google APIs.
Those services are provided by their respective owners and may be subject to
separate terms and pricing.

